      "id": "packages_http_agents_ssrf_policy",
      "label": "SSRF Protection Policy",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "rationale": "Allows only http/https without URL credentials, blocks private/loopback/link-local/metadata/NAT64/IPv4-translated ranges, resolves and checks every DNS address, pins the validated IP with Host and TLS SNI to stop DNS rebinding, and re-validates redirects.",
      "source_file": "packages/http/AGENTS.md",
      "source_location": "line 31",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null
    },
    {
      "id": "packages_http_agents_idempotent_retry_policy",
      "label": "Idempotent and Keyed Retry Policy",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "rationale": "Only idempotent methods retry by default; POST and PATCH retry solely when an idempotencyKey is supplied so request bodies are never replayed unkeyed, and Retry-After overrides backoff up to 30 seconds.",
      "source_file": "packages/http/AGENTS.md",
      "source_location": "line 47",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null
    },
    {
      "id": "packages_http_agents_bounded_redacted_responses",
      "label": "Bounded Responses and Redacted Errors",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "rationale": "Timeouts cover the entire body read and responses are size-bounded (1 MiB default), while AponiaError details use safeUrl and omit response bodies, query strings, and credentials.",
      "source_file": "packages/http/AGENTS.md",
      "source_location": "line 44",
